# 19. ROLLBACK TESTING

================================================================================================================================

Atomic rollback was tested directly against the database using intentionally invalid execution data.

The test caused the insert portion to fail.

The expected behavior was:

```text
DELETE
    ↓
INSERT FAILURE
    ↓
ROLLBACK
```

The database returned the expected failure rather than leaving the old execution state partially deleted.

This established that the transaction boundary is functioning as intended.

